<title>USA: Quorum Health adopts holder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Quorum Health adopts holder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quorum Health Group Inc said its board adopted a stockholder rights plan on Thursday.</p>
<p>Under terms of the plan, common stock purchase rights will be distributed as a dividend at the rate of one right for each share of common stock held as of the close of business on April 28, 1997.  The plan would trigger if a person or group bought or offered to buy 15 percent or more of Quorum.</p>
<p>The company said it not presently aware of any third-party proposals to acquire the company nor any other merger-related activity.</p>
</text>
